OL,3,GNEWSA'Being part of Homeless World Cup
OL,4,Awas life-changing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 500 players will compete in
OL,7,Fthe tournament which aims to change the
OL,8,Fway homelessness is seen, understood
OL,9,Fand discussed.
